{"overview":"Law of the Jungle is a hybrid reality show combining elements of drama and documentary. The show is hosted by comedian Kim Byung Man, and each episode invites various celebrities from the various field. So far, many of idol stars and famous actors have appeared on the show. The show introduces viewers to exotic locations around the world where celebrities must work together in order to complete missions and survive. The cast celebrities travel to less habituated, natural places to survive on their own and experience life with local tribes and people. In each location, the guests are tasked to hunt and prepare their meals and also create shelter for the tribe. They sometimes confronted by many difficult challenges. Where will the tribe visit? And how will they survive on their own? Stay tuned to check out!","tagline":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":9,"y":2012,"poster":""},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":453,"y":2011,"poster":"/lnbpPAG1JHjAA6H5aA2wboxNNdh.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2012,"poster":"/o8YYdDP0T4CIRMEJtJ5mxpvaXBm.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":6,"y":2012,"poster":"/4n8LOKmjTw8KiHe435F6DfPHI8E.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":12,"y":2012,"poster":"/kxzhkHJTZFkrHu877HzGlDjE4EE.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":10,"y":2012,"poster":"/7aUSuyt7Zx6T6LG4RqcVnLvLhEC.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":10,"y":2013,"poster":"/it8fpI8XD7B4X3DVZXTmwS7agcE.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":10,"y":2013,"poster":"/d9HJWKlqLQKNWai7SPectXIkvHH.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":10,"y":2013,"poster":"/5IQ5DUuoClPTslWCIVaVUZltZuh.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":9,"y":2013,"poster":"/91rydut5qRjDK0gAUSpvlaFvM4I.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":10,"y":2013,"poster":"/vThHba8aoitc02nh1oZf4PQ9uQE.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":8,"y":2014,"poster":"/5eYPChGmjJaYyxjhHcPkoXzKUTZ.jpg"},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":9,"y":2014,"poster":"/5yJyteUBUtuI5pAB6JDP8bS3mCo.jpg"},{"n":13,"name":"فصل 13","ep":9,"y":2014,"poster":